<mjml lang="en" dir="ltr">
    <mj-head>
        <mj-title>Reminder: Two Live Grace Webinars Next Week</mj-title>
        <mj-preview>Wednesday 9 and Thursday 10 September, 11:00am on Microsoft Teams. There is still time to reserve a seat.</mj-preview>
        <mj-breakpoint width="600px" />
        <mj-attributes>
            <mj-all font-family="Ubuntu, Arial, sans-serif" />
            <mj-text padding="0" color="#3a3a4a" font-size="16px" line-height="1.65" />
            <mj-section padding="0" />
            <mj-class name="heading" padding="20px 32px 8px" color="#220a99" font-size="26px" font-weight="700" line-height="1.25" letter-spacing="-0.01em" />
            <mj-class name="subheading" padding="16px 32px 4px" color="#220a99" font-size="19px" font-weight="700" line-height="1.3" letter-spacing="-0.005em" />
            <mj-class name="paddit" padding="8px 32px" color="#3a3a4a" font-size="16px" font-weight="400" line-height="1.65" />
            <mj-class name="lead" padding="8px 32px" color="#2a2a3a" font-size="17px" font-weight="400" line-height="1.65" />
            <mj-class name="date" padding="0 32px" color="#5a4fb0" font-size="14px" font-weight="500" align="right" letter-spacing="0.02em" />
            <mj-class name="header-title" padding="16px 32px 4px" color="#220a99" font-size="28px" font-weight="700" line-height="1.2" letter-spacing="-0.015em" />
            <mj-class name="header-issue" padding="0 32px 16px" color="#5a4fb0" font-size="15px" font-weight="600" letter-spacing="0.08em" />
            <mj-class name="event-label" padding="18px 32px 2px" color="#5a4fb0" font-size="13px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="0.09em" />
            <mj-class name="event-name" padding="0 32px 4px" color="#220a99" font-size="18px" font-weight="700" line-height="1.35" />
            <mj-class name="event-meta" padding="0 32px 8px" color="#3a3a4a" font-size="15px" font-weight="500" line-height="1.6" />
            <mj-class name="cta-heading" padding="8px 25px" color="#220a99" font-size="24px" font-weight="700" line-height="1.3" align="center" letter-spacing="-0.01em" />
            <mj-class name="cta-text" padding="8px 32px 20px" color="#3a3a4a" font-size="16px" line-height="1.65" align="center" />
            <mj-class name="footer-text" padding="8px 25px" color="#7a7a8a" font-size="13px" line-height="1.5" align="center" />
            <mj-button background-color="#220a99" color="#ffffff" font-size="16px" font-weight="600" inner-padding="14px 36px" border-radius="8px" letter-spacing="0.02em" />
            <mj-divider border-color="#e6e1f7" border-width="1px" padding="20px 32px 4px" />
            <mj-social icon-size="28px" mode="horizontal" align="center" inner-padding="0 8px" />
        </mj-attributes>
        <mj-html-attributes>
            <mj-selector path=".flexy table">
                <mj-html-attribute name="data-id">42</mj-html-attribute>
            </mj-selector>
        </mj-html-attributes>
        <mj-style>
            .flexy table { margin: 0; }
            a { color: #220a99; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; text-underline-offset: 3px; transition: color 0.2s ease; }
            a:hover { color: #5a4fb0; }
            .article-list { margin: 4px 0 0; padding-left: 22px; }
            .article-list li { margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.65; padding-left: 4px; }
            .article-list li::marker { color: #5a4fb0; }
            strong { color: #220a99; font-weight: 700; }
            @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
                .mobile-pad { padding: 16px 8px !important; }
                .mobile-center { text-align: center !important; }
                .mobile-center img { margin: 0 auto !important; }
            }
        </mj-style>
    </mj-head>
    <mj-body width="1080px" background-color="#f5f3fc">
        <mj-include path="assets/styles/screen.css" type="css" />
        <mj-raw><!-- Message body --></mj-raw>

        <mj-raw><!-- Top accent bar --></mj-raw>
        <mj-section background-color="#220a99" padding="0">
            <mj-column>
                <mj-spacer height="4px" />
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-raw><!-- Header --></mj-raw>
        <mj-section background-color="#dfd9fd" background-size="cover" background-repeat="no-repeat" padding="28px 8px">
            <mj-column vertical-align="middle" width="60%">
                <mj-text mj-class="header-title">Rapid Information Systems Newsletter</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="header-issue">SEPTEMBER 2026  ·  ISSUE #12</mj-text>
            </mj-column>
            <mj-column vertical-align="middle" width="40%" css-class="mobile-center">
                <mj-image align="right" width="200px" padding="0 24px" src="assets/images/rapid-is-logo.png" alt="Rapid Information Systems Logo" title="Rapid Information Systems" />
                <mj-text mj-class="date" css-class="update-date"></mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-raw><!-- Main content --></mj-raw>
        <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="36px 8px 24px">
            <mj-column vertical-align="middle">
                <mj-text mj-class="lead" padding="0 32px 12px">Dear {firstName},</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">A quick reminder that our two live <strong>Grace</strong> webinars take place next week. If you have not reserved a seat yet, there is still time.</mj-text>

                <mj-text mj-class="heading">Grace: Governance, Risk &amp; Compliance Solutions for the Public Sector</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">Forty-five minutes, live on Microsoft Teams. Pick whichever session suits your diary.</mj-text>

                <mj-text mj-class="event-label">FOR CURRENT CUSTOMERS</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="event-name">Wednesday 9 September 2026</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="event-meta">11:00am to 11:45am<br />Microsoft Teams</mj-text>
                <mj-button align="left" padding="4px 32px 8px" href="https://events.teams.microsoft.com/event/2fd1dd4b-d5a3-4d72-ae35-9099e38035c5@cb480f9d-c52c-4096-a621-442810be7029" title="Reserve your seat, Wednesday 9 September">Reserve your seat</mj-button>

                <mj-text mj-class="event-label">OPEN TO ALL</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="event-name">Thursday 10 September 2026</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="event-meta">11:00am to 11:45am<br />Microsoft Teams</mj-text>
                <mj-button align="left" padding="4px 32px 8px" href="https://events.teams.microsoft.com/event/78097fa9-a673-4f1e-8e2d-978ebd8b72ca@cb480f9d-c52c-4096-a621-442810be7029" title="Reserve your seat, Thursday 10 September">Reserve your seat</mj-button>

                <mj-text mj-class="paddit" padding="16px 32px 8px">Both sessions cover the same ground: a live walkthrough of Grace's risk registers, audit management, governance and policy sign-off, and committee reporting, plus the newest feature enhancements and what is next on the roadmap. Each one ends with a live Q&amp;A, so please bring your questions.</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">You will be able to join 15 minutes before each session begins. If you have already reserved a seat, there is nothing more to do and we look forward to seeing you there.</mj-text>

                <mj-divider />

                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">Neither date works? Reply to this email and we will arrange a walkthrough at a time that suits you. Our <strong>free 30-day trial</strong> of Grace is also still open, with full support from our team to get you set up.</mj-text>

                <mj-spacer height="8px" />
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">Any questions before next week, simply reply to this email or <a href="mailto:kumar.modi@email.rapid-is.co.uk?subject=Re%3A%20Grace%20webinars%2C%209%20and%2010%20September&body=Hi%20Kumar%2C%0A%0A">get in touch</a>.</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit">Best regards,</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="paddit" padding="4px 32px 0">The Rapid and Swifton Team</mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-raw><!-- CTA section --></mj-raw>
        <mj-section background-color="#dfd9fd" padding="44px 16px">
            <mj-column>
                <mj-text mj-class="cta-heading">Still time to reserve your seat</mj-text>
                <mj-text mj-class="cta-text">Wednesday 9 and Thursday 10 September, 11:00am on Microsoft Teams. Cannot make either date? Get in touch and we will find a time that works.</mj-text>
                <mj-button href="https://rapid-is.co.uk/contact/" title="Contact Rapid">Get In Touch</mj-button>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-raw><!-- Footer --></mj-raw>
        <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="32px 16px 12px">
            <mj-column>
                <mj-social css-class="flexy row gap-1">
                    <mj-social-element name="web-noshare" href="https://rapid-is.co.uk/" title="Web">Web</mj-social-element>
                    <mj-social-element name="linkedin-noshare" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/rapid-information-systems/" title="LinkedIn">LinkedIn</mj-social-element>
                </mj-social>
                <mj-divider padding="20px 32px 8px" />
                <mj-text mj-class="footer-text"><a href="{unsubscribe_link}">Unsubscribe</a></mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-raw><!-- Bottom accent bar --></mj-raw>
        <mj-section background-color="#220a99" padding="0">
            <mj-column>
                <mj-spacer height="4px" />
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>
    </mj-body>
</mjml>
